From cf53371a61dad8ca2f8d00978235935b15d04f66 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: ALHIJRAH Canada Desk <noreply@careergate.us>
Date: Mon, 16 Nov 2026 18:19:28 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] v2.3 sign-in routing and access recovery
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Sign-in card: new client (name + email, step indicator) and returning client (email; password as secondary link;
  recovery link). Verification screen with masked email, LTR code field (paste, autofill, Arabic-Indic digits).
- Server returns the account state after verification (no application / one draft / submitted / several / no
  account); nothing opens automatically. Existing accounts open from either entry and keep the registered name.
- «ابدأ الطلب» creates the draft server-side: idempotent per request key and one open draft per account
  (partial unique index), so concurrent requests share one draft.
- Access recovery: separate recovery codes table, normalized lookup (mobile with country code or case number),
  one open request per verified email + lookup, staff-only matching, staff review (status changes) and
  MANAGER completion in one guarded atomic batch: file email + identity keys change, previous case sessions,
  account sessions, pending codes and the case password are revoked; both addresses are notified; decisions are
  appended to access_recovery_events (UPDATE/DELETE refused by triggers).
- Header shows «دخول العملاء» signed out and «حسابي» signed in. Application page: service title, «متابعة»,
  «تم حفظ مسودتك» only after server confirmation, retry on offline/error.
- Migration 0033 (also photo tables). Tests: signin-recovery 7/7.

