- Photo assistant: official IRCC rulesets (PR digital/print, TR print/online) with source, page date, review
  date and ruleset version; server header/EXIF measurement; on-device MediaPipe analysis bound to the image
  SHA-256; PASS/RETAKE/REVIEW decided by the server; private R2 storage with 5-minute signed links; attach
  with replacement confirmation and version record; deletion and 30-day retention purge; explanation limited
  to the check list.
- /client/photo screen with camera capture (where permitted) and live guidance; entry card on the account
  and case screens.
- Header re-checks the session right after sign-in/sign-out.
- Mandatory visual FAIL without severity is raised to REVIEW.
